---
---

<div class="thesis frame">
  <div class="block col-2-3">
    <header class="reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">A thesis.</p>
      <h2>
        The screen looks back at you.<br>
        Fountain looks with you.
      </h2>
    </header>

    <div class="copy">
      <p class="reveal">
        Fountain is a small, considered object. You wear one version on your
        body. You set the other on a desk. Together they form an ambient AI —
        projecting useful intelligence into the world where you actually live,
        instead of pulling you back into a phone.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal">
        A turn arrow on your handlebars when you're somewhere new. The freshness
        of an avocado, on the avocado. A doorbell on a door without one. A meeting
        on the table you're already sitting at.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-meta);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  header h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.034em;
    line-height: 1.0;
    margin: 0 0 1.4em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    max-width: 22ch;
  }
  .copy p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 18px);
    line-height: 1.55;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1.4em;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  [data-revealed="true"] header { transition-delay: 0ms; }
  [data-revealed="true"] .copy p:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 240ms; }
  [data-revealed="true"] .copy p:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 400ms; }
</style>
